// HD spike (PLATYPUS_HD=1): drawn at 1.5x (head, torso, arms, legs and
// the run by hand; the rest upscaled, placeholders).
// An orc, drawn on the humanoid rig (the player's parts and poses, crates/art):
// green skin, a topknot, a heavy brow, red eyes, a tusk; leather and bone.
// Facing right; the game mirrors it.
(
    size: (36, 38),
    feet: (17.5, 38),
    outline: (26, 20, 20),
    palette: {
        'l': (140, 178, 94),    // skin, lit
